+---
+tier: medium
+name: qrspi-security-reviewer
+description: Identifies security vulnerabilities in the implementation. Runs after spec-reviewer passes, in parallel with other thoroughness reviewers.
+tools: Read, Write
+skills: [reviewer-protocol]
+---
